{"id":"n1-129","title":"Verb たら最後 (〜tara saigo)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that once a certain action happens, the situation changes irreversibly—usually in a negative way.","longExplanation":"The たら最後 grammar point indicates that once an action (in た-form) occurs, there is no going back and an unpleasant or unavoidable state follows. Often translated as 'once...then it's all over' or 'the moment...there’s no turning back.'","formation":"Verb-た form + ら最後","examples":[{"jp":"このゲームを始めたら最後、時間の経つのを忘れてしまいます。","romaji":"Kono gēmu o hajimetara saigo, jikan no tatsu no o wasurete shimaimasu.","en":"Once you start this game, you completely lose track of time.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゲーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"始める"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"最後","vocabId":"1293810","reading":"さいご"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経つ","vocabId":"1251100","reading":"たつ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忘れ","vocabId":"1519210","reading":"わすれる","baseForm":"忘れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまい","vocabId":"1579490","reading":"しまい","baseForm":"しまう"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"彼はビールを一杯飲み始めたら最後、止まらなくなります。","romaji":"Kare wa bīru o ippai nomihajimetara saigo, tomaranaku narimasu.","en":"Once he starts drinking a beer, he can't stop.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ビール","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一杯","vocabId":"1165670","reading":"いっぱい"},{"surface":"飲み","vocabId":"1169870","reading":"のむ","baseForm":"飲む"},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"始める"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"最後","vocabId":"1293810","reading":"さいご"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"止まら","vocabId":"1310620","reading":"とまる","baseForm":"止まる"},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8]},{"jp":"この本を読み始めたら最後、一気に読破してしまいました。","romaji":"Kono hon o yomihajimetara saigo, ikki ni dokuha shite shimaimashita.","en":"Once I started reading this book, I ended up finishing it in one go.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"読み","vocabId":"1456130","reading":"よみ","baseForm":"読む"},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"始める"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"最後","vocabId":"1293810","reading":"さいご"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一気に","vocabId":"1161730","reading":"いっきに"},{"surface":"読破","vocabId":"1456460","reading":"どくは"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまい","vocabId":"1579490","reading":"しまい","baseForm":"しまう"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"彼を怒らせたら最後、なかなか許してもらえないよ。","romaji":"Kare o okorasetara saigo, nakanaka yurushite moraenai yo.","en":"Once you make him angry, he won't forgive you so easily.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"怒ら","vocabId":"1445690","reading":"おこる","baseForm":"怒る"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"最後","vocabId":"1293810","reading":"さいご"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なかなか","vocabId":"1599420","reading":"なかなか"},{"surface":"許し","vocabId":"123286